    "goal": "Extrude bioink through a cryo-3 (500 µm) nozzle along a 31470 µm G-code path at 10.13 mm/min and report the extruded ink volume and filament mass for a footprint filled at 830 µm line pitch.",
    "rationale": "Single straight G-code path through a 500 µm cryo-nozzle. Extruded volume = π(d/2)²·L = π(250 µm)² × 31470 µm ≈ 6179 nL. Filament mass = volume × density = 6.179e-3 cm³ × 1.101 g/cm³ ≈ 6803 µg. Print time = 31470 µm at 10.13 mm/min ≈ 186 s. Fill lines = ⌈32623/830⌉ = 40. Ink density assumed uniform at 1.101 g/cm³.",
